    <string name="nodevice_body">Your phone can’t see the Apple TV on this network. Check these:</string>
    <string name="tip1">Phone and Apple TV must be on the same Wi-Fi. A 5 GHz network works better.</string>
    <string name="tip2">On Apple TV, set Settings > AirPlay and HomeKit > Allow Access to “Anyone on the Same Network”.</string>
    <string name="tip3">Apple TV may be asleep; wake it with the remote.</string>
    <string name="tip4">On Android TV, install the free “iMirror TV” app on the TV and open it.</string>
